{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b211bfc8-4bfb-8c11-b4a4-c1ee69453105",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:44:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fernando Costa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:40:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:40:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, hello. Sorry, I know it's after hours, City Hall's closed and I saw this number was the storm line, so I hope I'm calling the right place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:41:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You are, that's no problem. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:41:11-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, it's my mother's tree. Well, a tree in her yard. From the nor'easter Friday and Saturday, three days ago. It came down and the roots pulled right up out of the ground, like a big flat wall of dirt standing up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:41:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh my goodness. Is it on the house or a wire, or anybody hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:41:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, nobody's hurt. It fell toward the side of the yard. It's not on the house. I don't think it touched a wire, but I'm not totally sure, it's kind of near the pole. Sorry, I should've looked closer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:41:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's okay, don't go near it. Stay back from anything that might be a line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:41:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, yeah, I'll stay back. So, can I ask who I'm supposed to call? Like, is it the city that takes care of it, or is it the owner, or the electric company? I don't want to call the wrong people and waste your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:42:07-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a waste at all. Generally, if the tree was on private property, removing it is up to the property owner. If it's a city street tree or in the public right of way, that's us. And if it's touching or tangled in a wire, that goes to the utility, and you'd want to call them right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:42:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So if it's in her yard, it's hers to deal with. But if it's near the wire, I call the electric company."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:42:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Is the tree in her yard, or out by the sidewalk or street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:42:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, it's in the yard. Back from the sidewalk a bit. But the top end is kind of leaning out toward the sidewalk. Is that, uh, does that change it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:42:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the trunk was growing on her property, it's still hers, but if it's blocking the sidewalk or street, we'd want to know so we can make it safe. Is it blocking the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:43:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Partly, I think. A few branches are across it. Sorry, I'm on my cell, can you hear me okay? I have a ride coming in about twenty minutes, so I'm outside waiting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:43:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine. Let me take down the report so someone can look at the sidewalk part. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:43:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fernando Costa. F-E-R-N-A-N-D-O, Costa, C-O-S-T-A. Am I doing this right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:43:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're doing great. And a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:43:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0169."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:43:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-nine. Got it. Now I'll note a tree uprooted in a private yard after the nor'easter, branches partly across the sidewalk, possibly near a utility pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:43:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. Thank you. Should I also call the electric company about the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:43:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would, just to be safe, since you're not sure about the wire. They'll want to know. And for taking the tree itself away, your mom will need a tree service."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:43:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. I'll tell her. Sorry again for bothering you this late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:44:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bother. Someone from public works may call you back about the sidewalk. Take care, Fernando."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:44:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, you too. Bye."
    }
  ],
